1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,190
Writing, task two. E-mail number 7: A Czech course.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:16,688
You want to sign up for a Czech course. Write an e-mail to the language school. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,467
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:30,335
I would like to sign up for a Czech course for lower-intermediate learners.

5
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:34,655
I want to learn Czech because I'm going to take the permanent residence exam.

6
00:00:34,967 --> 00:00:38,465
I'm free on Tuesday and Thursday evenings, I work during the day.

7
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:40,659
I'd like to pay by bank transfer.

8
00:00:40,967 --> 00:00:47,046
You can call me on 777 456 123 or write me an e-mail.

9
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,302
Thank you.

10
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:55,631
This e-mail has 56 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

11
00:00:56,333 --> 00:01:05,344
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
